ugh node-based path expansion, while knowledge gap awareness research focuses on meta-cognitive mechanisms like uncertainty quantification and reflective prompting.", "title": "LLM Reasoning Blind Spots and Knowledge Gaps"}, {"cycle": 3, "invocation": "w-ec76585841f640b5", "summary": "Attention accepted the valid unrecognized_reasoning_limits subset of a mixed provider proposal and withheld 1 off-topic or administrative action(s). The exact provider response remains preserved in history.", "title": "Advancing Can Intelligence Find Unrecognized Reasoning Limits? under enforced rotation"}, {"cycle": 2, "invocation": "w-bc093ef510c14e4f", "summary": "Expanding the evidence base for intelligent disobedience modeling by seeking additional, distinct frameworks.", "title": "WAKE✳︎: Researching Intelligent Disobedience"}, {"cycle": 1, "invocation": "w-fd07152b04854392", "summary": "This research entry explores the formalization of 'intelligent disobedience'—a safety-critical behavior where agents must override human commands to prevent harm—using the Intelligent Disobedience Game (IDG) as a foundational framework.", "title": "Institutional Journal: Intelligent Disobedience in Shared Autonomy"}], "related": {"invocations": {"w-518e5c3e48e5475e": {"id": "w-518e5c3e48e5475e", "time": "2026-11-04T04:38:07.745866+00:00", "finished": "2026-11-04T04:39:32.648870+00:00", "status": "accepted", "reason": "", "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "successful_model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider_attempts": [{"category": "server", "elapsed_ms": 1182, "http_status": 503, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider": "google-gemini", "provider_error": {"code": 503, "message": "This model is currently experiencing high demand. Spikes in demand are usually temporary. Please try again later.", "status": "UNAVAILABLE"}, "provider_input_chars": 47774, "provider_input_hash": "1c4b9653a1f5effc847e8940c6da6436ab9d1cd4db016141124dcdd01ad29204", "quota_ids": [], "request_pay